window.products.push({"id":694532,"name":"ERGO LIFE Air Fryer Oven 15.3 qt, 16-in-1 Digital Convection Oven with LCD TouchScreen &BPA-Free Accessories, Electric Hot Oven for Rotisserie Dehydra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v15B0TsRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Family Size】15.3QT large capacity and 3-layer airflow racks. You can use three layers to bake different food, or roast a whole chicken. Family members's different dietary preferences can be satisfied a the same time. And you can observe the food through the transparent window, the cooking process is visible and under control, no need to worry about the food being too raw or scorched. 【Simple and Smart Control】Simply touch the digital LCD screen, select 1 of the 16 preset modes, then all you need to do is to wait for the cooking done.You can also manually adjust the time or temperature according to specific need. Rotisserie, dehydrator, roast, bake, defrost all in one air fryer. Chicken/Chips/Fish/Steak/Fries/Pizza/Cake/Popcorn, cook any food you like! 【Oiless and 360° Cooking.】Our digital air fryer utilizes 360° hot turbine airflow to circulately fry up food, it use no oil and produces at least 90% less fat than the traditional fryer. Feel free to enjoy the good taste of your favorite food at its low fat version. 【Rich Accessories】Comes with 5 BPA-Free accessories: wire rack, mesh basket, fetch rack, chicken fork, and drip tray. Note: The drip tray can be only used on the bottom layer, if it's put at the middle layer, it will get burnt and blackened due to overheat. All the accessories are removable and easy to clean. 【Advanced Safe & Memory Function】Solid metal shell. The auto-off function ensurs it to stop heating automatically when you pull out the basket and will continue to cook with the previous mode when you put it back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v15B0TsRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ERGO LIFE","source_asin":"B08FHXKZ5Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-694532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FHXKZ5Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FHXKZ5Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
