window.products.push({"id":694647,"name":"Amandir 153Pcs Boho Blush Balloon Garland Arch Kit, Double-Stuffed Nude Cream Peach Dusty Rose Pink Gold Confetti Metallic Balloons for Bridal Baby Sh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bLX01dVwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Blush Balloon Garland Kit: 12\"(8*2 double-stuffed nude/8retro pink/8rose gold confetti/8gold metallic); 10\"(15*2double-stuffed nude/15dusty pink/4heart-shaped rose gold foil/5rose gold metallic/5gold metallic/10pure white); 5\"(10*2double-stuffed nude/10retro pink/10pure white); 1pcs tying tool, 1pcs silver ribbon, 1pcs 100 glue points and 1pcs balloon arch strip. Everything you need are in rich boho balloon garland kit. You'll get nice decor effect with blush pink balloons! DIY Boho Balloon Garland: Simply inflate double-stuffed nude balloons with a balloon inflator, slip the inner dark balloon knot into holes on the decorating strip and then you'll get a unique balloon looks better than others'. We advise inflate blush pink balloons to random sizes. You can make full use of your creativity to combine dusty rose blush balloons of different colors and sizes and connect with glue points and balloon arch strip to achieve amazing effect you want in a complete shape. Multiple-scenarios Applications: Blush balloon garland will be the hit on your big days such as birthday parties, baby shower for girls, bridal shower, gender reveal, wedding, engagement parties, global para fiestas etc! With these elegant blush pink balloons, add more romantic festive atmosphere to your home, leave a deep impression on your relatives, friends and guests, and also let you show a unique style on the important days! Good Quality: Our cream peach dusty rose blush balloons are made of natural latex, which is thicker and safer than others. These blush pink balloons have been rigorously tested and selected manually, thus they are very safe to be used even by children. The balloon tool can make knots quickly, be used to stick together and form a boho balloon garland easier. Really free your hands! More Matters Need Special Attention: Please do not inflate the blush pink balloons to full in case of sudden popping. To prevent choking incidents, children are supposed to be exposed to our cream blush balloon garland under parents' supervision. And also you’d better pay attention to reserve boho balloon garland kit from high temperature, sharp objects and excessive friction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bLX01dVwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amandir","source_asin":"B0C4FDW74M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-694647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4FDW74M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4FDW74M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
