window.products.push({"id":694993,"name":"COTA Global Angelfish Refrigerator Bobble Magnets Set of 3 - Assorted Color Fun Cute Sea Life Animal Bobble Head Magnets for Kitchen Fridge, Home Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f6FSIQKeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE LOVELY ANGELFISH BOBBLE MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Bring out the kid in you & display your cute collection of magnets! Play with the bobble magnets whenever you are bored, stressed or when taking time off. CoTa Global's Angelfish Bobble Fridge Magnets will surely entertain anyone who sees the cute magnets bobble with just a little tap. A must-have magnetic home & office accessory to use as convenient noteholders. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home & office ornament for magnet collectors & sea life animal lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique decorative bobble magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures & random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones or to post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Includes CoTa Global Assorted Color Set of 3 Angelfish Bobble Fridge Magnets. The magnets feature colorful angelfish floating around & moving their characteristic fins. The bobble magnetic decor set features realistic details and are colored with vibrant colors making them the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. Cute kitchen fridge magnets that measure about 4 inches long. HIGH-QUALITY SEA LIFE BOBBLE HEAD MAGNETS – Fun magnets for refrigerator are made of premium quality plastic construction, durable springs, and strong magnet attached to the back of each 3D-shaped colorful angelfish figure. The angelfish figures are connected to durable springs that make them bobble and bounce as you open and close the refrigerator door. Make the magnets shake by gently tapping the beautifully designed floating angelfish . IDEAL USE FOR THE SEA CREATURE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboards, cabinet, & any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Angelfish magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge & an amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos, & drawings. Perfect set of functional multi-use magnets for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f6FSIQKeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B003IQZHC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-694993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003IQZHC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003IQZHC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
